WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.530
It's not working! I can't transform!

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.240
Imprison both in the prison tower,
where they will be held indefinitely.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.750
What? Indefinitely?

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:12.120
You're a good person, Ms. D'Arc.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.790
Jeanne is fine.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.840
Okay, Ms. Jeanne.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.460
Then what about Mugaro?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.380
She's a quiet girl with a mysterious power.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.970
Was the child not a boy?

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.680
No, she is a girl.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.010
She was a girl, right?

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.600
I am going to leave this place.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:34.440
Let's get out of here
and go see Mugaro together.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.450
Break time!

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.120
Now.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.340
There it is.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:17.980
What is it?

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.240
Jeanne, I'm in.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.580
You there.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.330
What are you doing?

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.540
Why are you here?

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.540
My apologies.

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:39.540
I lost track of time
and did not hear you call for break.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.720
Your break is ending soon.

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:47.180
Get back to work.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.050
I am sorry.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:56.060
What an annoying prisoner.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:05.490
Damn it! She's escaping!

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.580
T

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.850
Come, El.

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.770
You have nothing to fear.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:23.670
We will set free the divine power
sleeping inside you.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.420
Do you not wish to see your mother?

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.430
Somewhere within you,

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:36.600
you have the power to save your mother
from the humans

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:41.480
and resume life together with her.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:44.230
But that is not all.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.770
Your power

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:51.320
has the ability to bring back peace
to this unstable world.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:55.280
In order for you to live a quiet
life with your mother,

00:04:55.490 --> 00:05:00.080
you must use your power
to become this world's savior.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.580
How do you feel, El?

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.880
I will take back my mother.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:18.490
What is that?

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.660
It is a map of this dungeon.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:24.080
I have been adding to it
since the day I was put in here.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.920
You're such a good drawer, Jeanne.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.250
More importantly, study it carefully.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:33.210
This is where we are now.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:38.430
In order to escape,
first we must head for this spot here.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:42.180
Our only hope for reaching the surface
lies with us using this device.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:46.140
This will be the most difficult challenge
for our escape.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.350
I will take them out.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:51.520
The military guards?

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.520
Even you could not take them all on.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:57.860
I'll let you in on something,
since you're a good person, Jeanne.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.740
I can actually—

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.950
Let's go.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:24.060
How did you get up here, young lady?

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:28.060
Where are your parents?

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.230
If you're lost...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.970
Emergency! We have an intruder!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.660
Over there!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:27.640
Rage of Bahamut

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.140
What were you about to say earlier?

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:31.770
Oh, that?

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.600
I was about to tell you my secret.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.060
Secret?

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.730
I can actually transform into a dragon.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:41.280
How?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.570
It happens when I get close to a man

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.950
and my heart starts pounding.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:47.620
Is this really true?

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.490
I'm dragonfolk.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.990
If that is true,

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.290
could it be any man?

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.130
It would work with Kaisar.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:01.800
Probably.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:07.550
Unfortunately, the male prison
is on the other side of the device.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:10.850
We would have to go through
the guards to reach it.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.430
If only there was another path...

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:14.930
But I do not know of any.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.850
I see.

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:19.060
Even if we reach the device,

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:21.480
we still need to do something
about the guards.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:23.150
What is it?

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.990
Look, Jeanne.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.070
It's a cute little spider.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.550
Jeanne.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:47.170
What are you thinking,
trying to scream like that?

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:49.510
My apologies.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:52.180
I am afraid of spiders.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:18.080
I have been telling you that
we still need time to complete it.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.710
Hurry. It will not be long
before His Highness will require it.

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:28.470
-You speak as if the task is simple.
-What is that king up to?

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:42.900
Go get him!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.080
Yeah!

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.880
Demon Buer.

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:12.590
We acknowledge your skill in battle,

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:16.310
and hereby appoint you
captain of the Demon Division.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:39.790
Sinful king of man,

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:43.080
heed your gods.

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:53.260
We request the swift return

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:57.970
of all you have stolen in your attacks
on our holy temples.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:05.940
Furthermore, you are to release saint
Jeanne D'Arc to our custody at once.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:09.360
Instead of making grand proclamations,

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.940
why don't you try to take it by force?

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.630
-Stand down, Sofiel.
-Yes, My Lady.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.250
If you will not comply,

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.420
I suppose we have no other choice.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.670
We will do as you say,

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:36.930
and take back what is ours by force.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:41.430
Just because you have the saint's child,
do not get carried away.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.850
It will only hasten your deaths.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:48.480
Death is what the gods shall bestow unto man.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:05.620
Do you understand now just how foolish

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:08.210
mankind has become?

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:12.090
The tyrant Charioce XVII has changed mankind,

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.720
propelling the world into instability.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:21.390
He is also the same man
who is keeping your mother prisoner.

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:28.230
You must use your powers
to correct humanity's path

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:31.190
and save your mother.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:38.410
I will correct mankind and take back my mother.

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:39.910
Yes.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:42.660
That is my duty.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:43.790
Yes, that is right.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.100
Apparently we're going to war with the gods now.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:09.480
Our king sure likes to fight.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:12.360
I wish he would think about the ones
who have to evacuate.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.110
Are you stupid!

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:16.110
Don't say anything like that out loud.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.240
Don't fight the gods.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.200
The king should return what he stole from the gods.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.280
Free Lady Jeanne.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.790
Can you believe them?

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:34.420
They've got courage, stirring things up like that.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:54.150
The capital has changed.

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.730
It didn't used to be so dangerous.

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.400
I hope Nina is okay.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:03.070
I hope she's not crying in her cell.

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:08.620
I guess even you have things
you're scared of, Jeanne.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:11.540
Everyone has something they are afraid of.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.670
That's a relief.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.750
I guess you're just a girl like the rest of us.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.260
That is enough idle chatter.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.010
The device is over there.

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:21.840
What should we do now?

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:26.180
There's only one option left.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:28.020
Forcing our way through.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:30.230
No. It is too dangerous.

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:32.520
But there's no other way.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:34.770
Don't worry.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.690
I'm strong.

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.100
We're being attacked.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.000
Jeanne!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.600
Almost.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.810
But playtime is over.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.190
You've saved me the trouble
of walking to your cell.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.900
What business do you have with me?

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:04.400
The gods have declared war.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.490
If they attack us,

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:10.950
I will crush them without mercy.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:17.830
The gods will likely use your child in this war.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.670
If your child joins them, he will die as well.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.880
This is your final chance.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.800
Pledge your fealty to me.

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.260
Persuade your son, and prevent this war.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.770
You are the only one who can do this.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:37.770
Why ask this of me now
after everything you've done?

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:43.440
There are still those who follow the gods.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:46.780
If a former saint like you
would pledge yourself to me,

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:50.450
then we would be able to put an end
to their delusions.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:52.830
What say you?

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.500
Neither the gods nor your son will have to die,

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.370
and needless blood will not be spilled.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.790
What guarantee do I have
that you will keep your promise?

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:05.960
There are a number of lives that can be saved
by your choice.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.260
That is what I am saying.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:13.680
Now, what is your decision?

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:17.680
Stop it. Don't pick on Jeanne.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:20.520
Why do you always pick on people?

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:23.860
What's so fun about that?

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:32.030
What do you want?

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.870
Are you enjoying prison life?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.620
Of course I'm not!

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:42.540
Is that why you're fleeing?

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.460
No...

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:53.390
You haven't changed.

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:56.970
What? What do you know!

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:10.360
Would you dance with me again?

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:20.250
I can't believe it.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.260
How can it...

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:32.930
Your Highness.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:35.550
I will not be following you.

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:42.060
I cannot betray the gods,
nor the people who believe in me.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:47.270
I see. Then I have no other choice.

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.150
You can return to your cell and wait

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:54.160
as your child and your precious gods
march to the slaughter.

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:38.950
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:43.160
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:47.040
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:51.300
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.800
So fragile
Yet strong

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:55.930
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:59.930
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:04.180
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:08.270
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:08.650 --> 00:22:12.570
Let's end it all today

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:16.860
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:20.870
Let's end it all today

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:25.790
I've taken my last, pointless breath

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:34.510
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:39.340
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:46.350
A new morning is coming

00:23:30.100 --> 00:23:31.150
What was that?

00:23:39.320 --> 00:23:40.570
Rita!

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:49.660
- Favaro!
- What is it!? Why are you so close!

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:53.250
I'm just so happy to see you again!

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:54.420
What the hell?

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:58.590
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "The Great Escape."

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:01.180
- Have you always been like this?
- Is it that noticeable?

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.930
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:07.270
Baha Baha Baha Soul.

00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:10.520
You'll watch next time too, right?
